* ADDCNTS - total the counters in a fullword array.
*   Parameters (R1): A(array), A(entry count), A(sum).
*   Returns 8 when the sum overflows, otherwise 0.
ADDCNTS  CSECT
ADDCNTS  AMODE 31
ADDCNTS  RMODE ANY
         STM   14,12,12(13)       save registers
         LR    12,15              base register
         USING ADDCNTS,12
         LM    2,4,0(1)           array, A(entries), A(sum)
         L     3,0(,3)            entry count
         SR    5,5                running sum
         LTR   3,3                empty array?
         BNP   STORE              yes, the sum is zero
NEXTCNT  A     5,0(,2)            accumulate
         BO    TOOBIG             overflowed
         LA    2,4(,2)            next counter
         BCT   3,NEXTCNT
STORE    ST    5,0(,4)            pass the sum back
         SR    15,15              rc 0
         B     EXIT
TOOBIG   LA    15,8               rc 8
EXIT     L     14,12(,13)
         LM    0,12,20(13)
         BR    14
         END   ADDCNTS
